# Boggart Cursecrafter: dying at the same time as another Goblin you control, its ability still triggers for that Goblin (the
# 2025-11-17 ruling; a leaves-the-battlefield ability looks back, CR 603.10a). Bot1 has the Cursecrafter and a Feisty Spikeling
# (a changeling, so a Goblin, CR 702.73a); Bot2's Wrath of God destroys both at once, and the Cursecrafter deals 1 to Bot2 for the
# Spikeling, none for itself ("another").

